{"id":"pmlock.1","n":"pmlock","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"pcp-doc","ver":"6.3.7-1.el9_6","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/p/pcp-doc-6.3.7-1.el9_6.noarch.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/pmlock.1.gz","sha256":"f73fe46424c7f108ce8e6369bfe1d755091b76c19f40f7cd6ea42466e1785173","date":"PCP","origin":"Performance Co-Pilot"}},"nopt":{"r":0},"desc":"simple file-based mutex","r":[["NAME","<p><b>pmlock</b> - simple file-based mutex</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>$PCP_BINADM_DIR/pmlock</b> [<b>-v</b>] <i>file</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>pmlock</b> attempts to acquire an exclusive lock by creating <i>file</i> with a mode of 0.</p> <p>The exit status is 0 for success, 1 for failure.</p> <p>To release the lock, unlink <i>file</i>.</p> <p>In the event of a failure, the <b>-v</b> option produces an explanatory message on <i>stdout</i>.</p>"]]}